    "body": "Some discussion has already taken place around how we can support multicolored modules here: https://github.com/starship/starship/issues/132#issuecomment-520172694, though I'm not sure that would work when we don't have multiple segments, like in this case where the `character.symbol` segment has multiple colors within it.\r\n\r\nI'll be thinking about ways to tackle this one. 🤔 ",
