    "updated_at": "2019-09-10T15:45:27Z",
    "body": "I actually liked this part of theme `sorin` enough that I manually ported it over to theme `garrett`, along with a couple other QoL improvements (though it's pretty much abandoned now, my configs were [in a prezto fork](https://github.com/chipbuster/prezto) for a while).\r\n\r\nIt wouldn't be too difficult to hardcode a character for this, but I'm in agreement with matchai that I don't really see how we could do it in a principled manner with out some code changes...definitely seems worth looking into though.",
