    "body": "I was thinking about this, and we could do something like this:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[character]\r\nsymbol = [[\"❯\", \"red\"], [\"❯\", \"orange\"], [\"❯\", \"green\"]]\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd then grab the `character.symbol` as an array and then iterate over it and keep appending the different characters with there different styles.",
