    "updated_at": "2019-09-16T08:18:48Z",
    "body": "Thanks for your input @johnletey. If that was possible, it would be great. We have to be aware that this might introduce a breaking change as the `symbol` setting used to be a scalar value before and it would become an array.\r\nBut probably there is a way to support both options in the config. \r\nOr we simply go with the array for simplicity and adjust the documentation accordingly.\r\nBoth cases would be fine in my book as we have not reached 1.0 yet.",
